    "title": "Varsity Football defeats Cupertino High School 66-27 during its annual Helmet Game - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sih Yu (Melody) Lin ,\n1 days ago Varsity Football defeated Cupertino High School 66-28 on Friday, Nov. 7, winning the Helmet Game, an annual competition between MVHS and CHS. The Matadors were able to secure the Helmet Trophy for the second year in a row, and scored the highest number of points in the history of the Helmet Game. As the last game of the 2025-2026 football season, the game was also Senior Night for the Football, Dance and Cheer teams. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
